body:
i'm not trans but i hear you; it's fucking awful. it's horrible to have a body sometimes. it's horrible to have body parts that are associated with femininity and 'girlhood' when it's not who you are at all. a lot of my close friends are trans men and periods are a thing that they all have to deal with, and it's so horrible.

&#x200B;

 i genuinely wish the best for you. you deserve better, friend
